      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "Readiness probe treats every symbolic-ref failure as a detached HEAD",
      "description": "The catch handles every failure from `git symbolic-ref -q HEAD` as `DETACHED_HEAD`, not just Git\u2019s detached-HEAD exit. For example, the readiness probe is given a 60-second timeout by `gateByReadiness`; if that command times out or Git fails for another reason, the fix is reported as deferred because the checkout is detached. That misreports the cause and hides an operational failure. Distinguish the detached-HEAD result from other Git failures, and surface or defer those failures with an accurate reason.",
